{"seq":2,"slug":"inference-cost-curve","title":"推理成本曲线与硬件经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/token-pricing-and-inference-economics/inference-cost-curve","wordCount":2039,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"推理成本曲线与硬件经济\">推理成本曲线与硬件经济</h1><p>API 价目表上的那一行数字——比如 Claude Opus 4.8 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>输入</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 输入 /</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输入</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span></span></span></span></span>25 输出（每百万 token，见 <a href=\"https://www.aimagicx.com/blog/llm-api-pricing-comparison-2026\">Anthropic 定价汇总，aimagicx 2026</a>）——是整条供给链层层折叠之后的最终零售价。它背后压着一条真实的物理成本曲线：一块 GPU 每小时烧掉固定的折旧与电费，能在这一小时里吐出多少 token，决定了厂商的边际成本，也决定了价目表能压到多低还不亏本。要理解 token 定价，先得拆开这条从「GPU 小时」到「每百万 token 成本」的换算链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从-gpu-小时到每-token-成本\">核心概念：从 GPU 小时到每 token 成本</h2><p>定价表是结果，成本曲线是原因。一块加速卡的租金是按时间计的固定支出，而它产出的 token 数随负载剧烈变化。把两者相除，才得到厂商真正关心的单位经济量——每百万 token 成本（$/MTok）。</p>\n<p>单位成本的基本恒等式很简单：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>tok</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>gpu</mtext></msub><mrow><mn>3600</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{tok}} = \\frac{P_{\\text{gpu}}}{3600 \\times T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tok</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3600</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gpu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>gpu</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{gpu}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gpu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每 GPU 小时租金（美元），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是该卡每秒产出的 token 数（tokens/s），分母把小时折算成秒。一块 H100 在 GMI Cloud 标价约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.00</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>U</mi><mtext>小时，服务</mtext><mi>L</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>270</mn><mi>B</mi><mtext>时约</mtext><mn>50</mn><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>s</mi><mtext>，于是每</mtext><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>约</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.00/GPU 小时，服务 Llama-2 70B 时约 50 tokens/s，于是每 token 约</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.00/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">GP</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">小时，服务</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ama</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">270</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时约</span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，于是每</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">约</span></span></span></span></span>0.00055/s 级别的瞬时成本（<a href=\"https://www.spheron.network/blog/gpu-cost-per-token-benchmark-llm-inference-2026/\">Spheron 2026 基准</a>）。关键洞察：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>gpu</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P*{\\text{gpu}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gpu</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在一小时内是常数，唯一能压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>tok</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C*{\\text{tok}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tok</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的杠杆是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 做大——而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 不是固定的，它随批大小（batch size）几乎线性增长，直到撞上显存或带宽墙。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[GPU 小时租金 P_gpu&lt;br/&gt;H100 约 2 美元/时] --&gt; B[除以 3600 得每秒成本]&#10;  B --&gt; C{每秒产出 token 数 T&lt;br/&gt;取决于 batch size}&#10;  C --&gt;|batch=1 低吞吐| D[单位成本高&lt;br/&gt;GPU 大量空转]&#10;  C --&gt;|batch=256 满载| E[单位成本低&lt;br/&gt;吞吐拉满 但单请求变慢]&#10;  D --&gt; F[厂商边际成本 C_tok]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[叠加毛利 + 峰值冗余&lt;br/&gt;得 API 价目表价格]\">flowchart TD\n  A[GPU 小时租金 P_gpu&lt;br/&gt;H100 约 2 美元/时] --&gt; B[除以 3600 得每秒成本]\n  B --&gt; C{每秒产出 token 数 T&lt;br/&gt;取决于 batch size}\n  C --&gt;|batch=1 低吞吐| D[单位成本高&lt;br/&gt;GPU 大量空转]\n  C --&gt;|batch=256 满载| E[单位成本低&lt;br/&gt;吞吐拉满 但单请求变慢]\n  D --&gt; F[厂商边际成本 C_tok]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[叠加毛利 + 峰值冗余&lt;br/&gt;得 API 价目表价格]</pre><p>下表把 2026 年主流加速卡的租金与相对吞吐放在一起，看「贵的卡是否真的更便宜」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>加速卡</th>\n<th>每 GPU 小时租金</th>\n<th>相对推理吞吐</th>\n<th>tok/$ 效率档位</th>\n<th>适配场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>H100 SXM</td>\n<td>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.00</mn><mtext>（</mtext><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi><mn>3</mn><mtext>年预留可压到 </mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.00（neo-cloud 3 年预留可压到 ~</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.00</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">eo</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年预留可压到</span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"> </span></span></span></span></span>1）</td>\n<td>基准 1.0x</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中等模型、通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H200</td>\n<td>~$2.60</td>\n<td>~1.4x</td>\n<td>0.49 M tok/$/hr 量级</td>\n<td>大显存模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B200 SXM6</td>\n<td>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.00</mn><mtext>（</mtext><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>低至</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.00（spot 低至</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.00</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">低至</span></span></span></span></span>2.07）</td>\n<td>~3x（Blackwell）</td>\n<td>0.73 M tok/$/hr 量级</td>\n<td>大模型批量推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GB200 NVL72</td>\n<td>~$8.00 有效/卡</td>\n<td>宣称 30x 量级</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>超大规模集群</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数据来自 <a href=\"https://www.gmicloud.ai/en/blog/comparing-gpu-pricing-large-language-models\">GMI Cloud GPU 定价对比</a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.spheron.network/blog/gpu-cost-per-token-benchmark-llm-inference-2026/\">Spheron 2026 基准</a>。注意 B200 虽然每小时租金是 H100 的两倍，但 tok/$ 效率（0.73 vs 0.49 M tok/$/hr）反超 H200——更贵的卡因为吞吐涨得更快，单位 token 反而更便宜。这正是「成本曲线」一词的意义：单看租金会得出错误结论，必须看吞吐归一化后的曲线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"prefill-与-decode-两个成本结构完全不同的阶段\">prefill 与 decode：两个成本结构完全不同的阶段</h2><p>把一次推理拆开看，会发现它不是一种工作负载，而是两种。prefill（处理输入 prompt）一次性吃下全部输入 token，能把 GPU 的矩阵乘单元喂满，是计算密集（compute-bound）的；decode（逐 token 生成）每次只算一个 token，算力利用率极低，是访存密集（memory-bound）的（<a href=\"https://www.usenix.org/system/files/osdi24-agrawal.pdf\">Sarathi-Serve, OSDI 2024</a>）。</p>\n<p>这个分裂直接决定了定价为什么输入比输出便宜得多。回看 2026 价目：GPT-5.4 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.50</mn><mtext>输入</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.50 输入 /</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.50</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输入</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span></span></span></span></span>15 输出，Gemini 3.1 Pro 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>输入</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 输入 /</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输入</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span></span></span></span></span>12 输出（<a href=\"https://www.aimagicx.com/blog/llm-api-pricing-comparison-2026\">aimagicx 2026</a>），输出价是输入价的 5-6 倍。原因不是厂商任性：prefill 阶段一块卡能并行处理几千个输入 token，摊到每 token 的成本极低；而 decode 阶段一块卡每秒只能挤出几十个输出 token，且 batching 收益虽大却受 KV cache 显存限制。两个阶段的边际成本差出一个数量级，价目表只是诚实地反映了这一点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  R[一次推理请求] --&gt; P[prefill 阶段&lt;br/&gt;处理输入 prompt]&#10;  R --&gt; D[decode 阶段&lt;br/&gt;逐 token 生成]&#10;  P --&gt; P1[计算密集&lt;br/&gt;GPU 算力跑满]&#10;  P --&gt; P2[每 token 成本低&lt;br/&gt;对应便宜的输入价]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[访存密集&lt;br/&gt;算力大量闲置]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[每 token 成本高&lt;br/&gt;对应昂贵的输出价]&#10;  P1 --&gt; S{prefill-decode 分离部署?}&#10;  D1 --&gt; S&#10;  S --&gt;|是| S1[各跑各的副本&lt;br/&gt;消除相互干扰]&#10;  S --&gt;|需迁移 KV cache| S2[要求高带宽互联&lt;br/&gt;否则得不偿失]\">flowchart TD\n  R[一次推理请求] --&gt; P[prefill 阶段&lt;br/&gt;处理输入 prompt]\n  R --&gt; D[decode 阶段&lt;br/&gt;逐 token 生成]\n  P --&gt; P1[计算密集&lt;br/&gt;GPU 算力跑满]\n  P --&gt; P2[每 token 成本低&lt;br/&gt;对应便宜的输入价]\n  D --&gt; D1[访存密集&lt;br/&gt;算力大量闲置]\n  D --&gt; D2[每 token 成本高&lt;br/&gt;对应昂贵的输出价]\n  P1 --&gt; S{prefill-decode 分离部署?}\n  D1 --&gt; S\n  S --&gt;|是| S1[各跑各的副本&lt;br/&gt;消除相互干扰]\n  S --&gt;|需迁移 KV cache| S2[要求高带宽互联&lt;br/&gt;否则得不偿失]</pre><p>2026 年的工程主流是把两个阶段拆到不同副本上（prefill-decode disaggregation）。好处是两类负载互不干扰，prefill 能以满效率跑、decode 能以最优 batch 跑；代价是 prefill 算完后要把 KV cache 迁移到 decode 副本，没有高带宽互联（如 NVLink）就会被搬运开销吃掉收益（<a href=\"https://bentoml.com/llm/inference-optimization/prefill-decode-disaggregation\">BentoML 推理优化手册</a>）。这也是为什么 GB200 NVL72 这类整机柜高带宽方案在大规模厂商手里特别值钱——它让分离部署的成本曲线真正下探。</p>\n<h2 id=\"batch-size-成本曲线上唯一可调的旋钮\">batch size：成本曲线上唯一可调的旋钮</h2><p>如果只能记住一件事，就是：推理的单位成本几乎完全由批大小决定。batch=1 意味着一个请求独占整块 GPU——延迟最低，但绝大部分算力空转；batch=256 意味着 GPU 满载——每请求成本被摊到极低，但每个请求都要排队等批次凑齐，延迟上升（<a href=\"https://mlechner.substack.com/p/the-economics-of-llm-inference-batch\">mlechner，LLM 推理经济学</a>）。</p>\n<p>这构成了著名的「推理三难」：吞吐、延迟、成本，三者不可兼得（<a href=\"https://www.digitalocean.com/blog/llm-inference-tradeoffs\">DigitalOcean，LLM 推理权衡</a>）。厂商的批处理 API 之所以能直接打五折（<a href=\"https://inference.net/content/llm-api-pricing-comparison/\">Inference.net 2026 对比</a>），正是因为离线批量任务对延迟不敏感，可以放心把 batch 拉满、把成本曲线压到最低点，再把省下的钱让给客户。</p>\n<p>用排队论的直觉量化这个权衡。设单卡满载吞吐为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，到达请求率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>，则有效利用率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\frac{\\lambda}{T_{\\max}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时单位成本最低但排队延迟急剧上升；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 太低则 GPU 空转、单位成本飙高。真实系统还要为应对尖峰流量而过度配置（overprovision）——按峰值买卡，谷时大量闲置。这也是模型实验室相对中小厂的结构性优势：它们流量足够大、足够平滑，能长期把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 维持在高位，从而拿到比转售方更低的真实成本（<a href=\"https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/blog/appsonazureblog/inference-at-enterprise-scale-why-llm-inference-is-a-capital-allocation-problem/4498754\">Microsoft，推理是资本配置问题</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本曲线随时间的整体下移\">成本曲线随时间的整体下移</h2><p>横截面上看的是「哪块卡更便宜」，纵向上看则是整条曲线每年大幅下移。GPT-4 级别的能力，2022 年底约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>，到</mtext><mn>2026</mn><mtext>年初已跌到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20/MTok，到 2026 年初已跌到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，到</span><span class=\"mord\">2026</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年初已跌到</span></span></span></span></span>0.30-$0.75/MTok，降幅超 98%（<a href=\"https://introl.com/blog/inference-unit-economics-true-cost-per-million-tokens-guide\">Introl，推理单位经济学</a>）。Epoch AI 的长期追踪显示，推理价格年降约 10x，比 PC 算力或互联网带宽的历史下降速度都快（<a href=\"https://epoch.ai/data-insights/llm-inference-price-trends\">Epoch AI，推理价格趋势</a>）。</p>\n<p>但厂商的毛利并没有因此变好，这就是 2026 年最值得记住的反直觉结论——「LLM 成本悖论」：单 token 价格跌了 280x，企业 AI 总支出却同期涨了 320%（<a href=\"https://www.ikangai.com/the-llm-cost-paradox-how-cheaper-ai-models-are-breaking-budgets/\">ikangai，成本悖论</a>）。驱动力是用量爆炸：agentic 工作流一个用户任务触发 10-20 次模型调用、RAG 把上下文撑大 3-5 倍、常驻监控 agent 7x24 烧算力。价格曲线在下移，消费曲线却以更陡的斜率上扬。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间点</th>\n<th>GPT-4 级能力价格（$/MTok）</th>\n<th>年降幅</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2022 Q4</td>\n<td>~$20</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>GPT-4 发布初期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2024</td>\n<td>~$2-4</td>\n<td>~10x</td>\n<td>蒸馏+量化普及</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026 Q1</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.30</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.30-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>0.75</td>\n<td>~10x</td>\n<td>高效模型如 DeepSeek V4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2027（预测）</td>\n<td>进一步降</td>\n<td>3-5x</td>\n<td>优化空间收窄，斜率放缓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2030（预测）</td>\n<td>较 2025 再降 &gt;90%</td>\n<td>1.5-2x</td>\n<td>Gartner 对万亿参数模型预测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>未来轨迹来自 <a href=\"https://www.gartner.com/en/newsroom/press-releases/2026-03-25-gartner-predicts-that-by-2030-performing-inference-on-an-llm-with-1-trillion-parameters-will-cost-genai-providers-over-90-percent-less-than-in-2025\">Gartner 2026 预测</a> 与上述来源。注意斜率本身在变缓：2021-2025 年的 10x/年靠的是低垂果实（量化、KV cache 优化、更高效注意力），随着这些被吃尽，2027 年起预计降到 3-5x，再往后趋向 1.5-2x。换言之，成本曲线的「免费下降」时代正在收尾，下一阶段的降本要靠硬件代际（Blackwell 之后）和系统级架构（分离部署、推测解码）硬啃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>价目表上的每百万 token 价是成本曲线的零售终点：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>tok</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>gpu</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3600</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{tok}} = P_{\\text{gpu}} / (3600 \\times T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tok</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gpu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3600</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，GPU 租金固定，唯一杠杆是把吞吐 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 做大。</li>\n<li>更贵的卡未必更贵：B200 的 tok/$ 效率（~0.73 M tok/$/hr）反超 H200，必须看吞吐归一化曲线而非裸租金。</li>\n<li>prefill 计算密集、decode 访存密集，二者边际成本差一个数量级——这就是输入价远低于输出价（如 GPT-5.4 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5 vs</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>15）的根本原因。</li>\n<li>batch size 是成本曲线上唯一可调旋钮，吞吐/延迟/成本三难不可兼得；批处理 API 打五折正是用延迟换成本。</li>\n<li>整条曲线年降约 10x（GPT-4 级从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>跌到</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20 跌到 &lt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">跌到</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span></span></span></span>0.75/MTok），但用量涨得更快导致「成本悖论」：单价跌 280x，总支出反涨 320%。</li>\n<li>降本斜率正在放缓：2027 年起预计从 10x/年降到 3-5x，再趋向 1.5-2x，未来降本要靠硬件代际与系统架构，而非低垂果实。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推理成本曲线与硬件经济","id":"推理成本曲线与硬件经济"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从 GPU 小时到每 token 成本","id":"核心概念-从-gpu-小时到每-token-成本"},{"level":2,"text":"prefill 与 decode：两个成本结构完全不同的阶段","id":"prefill-与-decode-两个成本结构完全不同的阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"batch size：成本曲线上唯一可调的旋钮","id":"batch-size-成本曲线上唯一可调的旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"成本曲线随时间的整体下移","id":"成本曲线随时间的整体下移"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"2026 年主流模型定价格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/token-pricing-and-inference-economics/pricing-models-2026"},"next":{"title":"提示词缓存与批处理的成本杠杆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/token-pricing-and-inference-economics/prompt-caching-and-batching"}}